The reference platforms are the OnePlus 13 and OnePlus Pad 3 / Pad 2 Pro
(erhai, OPD2415), based on SM8750 and Qualcomm FastConnect 7900, with the devices' existing
Snapdragon Sound/R2.2 offload components. Support on other hardware is not established by this
reference. Controller vendor command opcodes and session parameters (VSQC 0xFC0A) were
identified through live HCI protocol observation and runtime testing on lawfully
acquired reference hardware for the purpose of interoperability. Applicable
interoperability exceptions may include § 69d/§ 69e UrhG and Article 6 of
Directive 2009/24/EC.
The English patch edition changes identifiers and diagnostic text;
on 2026-10-01, it was built into crDroid 16.0 and validated on the reference
hardware with hardware DSP offload and dynamic rate switching.
In the crDroid 17.0 edition, aptX Adaptive uses extension codec slot 8, because
Android 17 assigns legacy slot 7 to LHDC.
crDroid 17.0 edition, 2026-10-20: strict source apply/reverse checks at the reference
commits in this NOTICE. The maintainer reported a running 17.0 ROM with Bluetooth
playback. Built into the maintainer's crDroid 17.0 ROM of 2026-10-22 (repository commit 4bdecab).
Complete per-mode device validation remains pending.
The crDroid 16.0 edition is kept on branch 16.0 of this repository.

